I’m able to reproduce this consistently with this playlist (
https://www.ultimate-guitar.com/user/playlist/view?id=2710225
) and navigating to the song Fullness using the playlist controls. The chords are incorrectly displayed as Am D A when it should be Am F C. When I back out then go to the song, the correct chords are displayed. It never seems to happen when going to the song directly, only when using the playlist controls. Reversing the order causes the issue as well, where going backwards in the playlist has the same incorrect chords.

