@macedonian: it is impossible to use Standalone apps within Ultimate Guitar Tabs, as, despite similarity in functions, in-app and standalone apps differ. You can contact us by opening support ticket
https://www.ultimate-guitar.com/about/contact.htm
to get more precise information.

I'm also currently using ScanScore (you can find out more about it here
https://scan-score.com/en/
). I like its features. This is one of the best programs that allow converting a MIDI file to sheet music and exporting your notes to almost any music program via the MusicXML or MIDI interface. For me, it works much better than similar software.

